                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Just Jump is an horrible platformer game.\n\nYour character walks forward perpetually and the jump is so buggy, it makes this mess literally unplayable. The obstacles have hitboxes outside of their sprites, there are only twenty levels, there are no level select or saves whatsoever. You have to play this terrible game in one sitting if you want to complete it. The music is painful to listen to and the graphics are poor.\n\nOverall, an atrocious platforming game. Not recommended.",
